    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ENG4_U02_L07_Q11</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.ENG4.W.01</p><p><strong>Passage:</strong> A student writes a narrative in which every paragraph explains the moral directly. What is the main weakness?</p>]]></text></questiontext>
