  <question type="multichoice">
    <name><text>ENG4_U02_L07_Q12</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> ENG4_U02_L07_Q12</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.ENG4.R.03</p><p><strong>Passage:</strong> Theo tells his mother he is leaving because the town is too small, but privately he fears he will never become anyone important if he stays. What does the private thought reveal?</p>]]></text></questiontext>
